[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3792608946","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115311#issuecomment-3792608946","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115311","id":3792608946,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7iDp6y","user":{"login":"cdemirer","id":41021322,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMDIxMzIy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41021322?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdemirer","html_url":"https://github.com/cdemirer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdemirer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdemirer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdemirer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdemirer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdemirer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdemirer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdemirer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdemirer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdemirer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-23T21:45:04Z","updated_at":"2026-01-23T21:45:04Z","body":"For some reason, available call depth before hitting stack overflow is lower for the non-main thread. So my hypothesis is that the default limit of 1024 is _just enough_ for the main thread, while it probably barely misses for the `Thread` thread.\n\nWould you please use this function to compare the call depths of both approaches?\n\n```gdscript\nfunc check():\n\tfor limit in 10000:\n\t\trecursive(limit)\n\t\tprint(limit)\n\nfunc recursive(limit, i=0):\n\tif i < limit:\n\t\trecursive(limit, i+1)\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3792608946/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3794325373","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115311#issuecomment-3794325373","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115311","id":3794325373,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7iKM99","user":{"login":"lostminds","id":17763524,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NzYzNTI0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17763524?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds","html_url":"https://github.com/lostminds","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-24T09:43:43Z","updated_at":"2026-01-24T09:43:43Z","body":"> For some reason, available call depth before hitting stack overflow is lower for the non-main thread. So my hypothesis is that the default limit of 1024 is _just enough_ for the main thread, while it probably barely misses for the `Thread` thread.\n\nI did this test to check and running this on the main thread got the expected overflow at 1024, but the last value printed was 1021 (maybe some print delay or just this count start was couple of calls deep?).\n\nHowever, on the separate thread the game exists with 365 as the last value printed. If this is indeed where the call stack overflows for the thread it's not just a little but a substantially lower threshold. \n\n```\n363\n364\n365\n--- Debugging process stopped ---\n```\n\nTo check this wasn't some threaded buffer delay on print on a separate thread I also checked just calling `tread.start(recursive.bind(370))` for example and it also causes the game to exit. \n\nDid you try this yourself and get similar results?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3794325373/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3794511314","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115311#issuecomment-3794511314","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115311","id":3794511314,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7iK6XS","user":{"login":"cdemirer","id":41021322,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMDIxMzIy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41021322?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdemirer","html_url":"https://github.com/cdemirer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdemirer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdemirer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdemirer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdemirer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdemirer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdemirer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdemirer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdemirer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdemirer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-24T11:34:38Z","updated_at":"2026-01-24T11:34:38Z","body":"> Did you try this yourself and get similar results?\n\nOn Linux,\n- with a custom dev build of 4.6-rc2, I get 389 and 287. (expected for dev builds)\n- with a production build of 4.6-rc2, I hit the 1024 limit from both threads.\n    - when I remove the limits from source code: ~6150 with both.\n\nSo the problem might be specific to macos.\n\nIs there a different max stack size for secondary threads in macos? Or maybe something on the engine-side call stack for the `Thread` thread takes huge amount of space? 🤔 ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3794511314/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3794513864","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115311#issuecomment-3794513864","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115311","id":3794513864,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7iK6_I","user":{"login":"cdemirer","id":41021322,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMDIxMzIy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41021322?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdemirer","html_url":"https://github.com/cdemirer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdemirer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdemirer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdemirer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdemirer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdemirer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdemirer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdemirer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdemirer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdemirer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-24T11:38:12Z","updated_at":"2026-01-24T11:41:35Z","body":"Yep. https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/72867#issue-1575253087\n\n> Although I did have some issues when testing with threads: on macOS and Windows the stack size seems to be smaller and it overflows way earlier (a bit over 200 depth). On Linux it's fine.\n\nSo, probably as a solution the threads should manually set stack size to match the main thread's stack size.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3794513864/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3794527087","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115311#issuecomment-3794527087","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115311","id":3794527087,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7iK-Nv","user":{"login":"cdemirer","id":41021322,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMDIxMzIy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41021322?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdemirer","html_url":"https://github.com/cdemirer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdemirer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdemirer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdemirer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdemirer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdemirer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdemirer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdemirer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdemirer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdemirer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-24T11:56:29Z","updated_at":"2026-01-24T11:56:29Z","body":"Apparently [this](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112094) has been done before, increasing the secondary thread stack size to 1 MB on macos. However, obviously this is still not enough to catch infinite recursion with the default limit of 1024.\n\nEither we need to increase it even more (to 8 MB), or reduce the default project setting `debug/settings/gdscript/max_call_stack` to something like 256.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3794527087/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3794531705","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115311#issuecomment-3794531705","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115311","id":3794531705,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7iK_V5","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-24T12:02:37Z","updated_at":"2026-01-24T12:02:37Z","body":"CC @bruvzg ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3794531705/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3794534623","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115311#issuecomment-3794534623","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115311","id":3794534623,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7iLADf","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-24T12:05:53Z","updated_at":"2026-01-24T12:05:53Z","body":"1024 is a valid limit only for release builds, for debug builds it is not, since a lot more stack space is used.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3794534623/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3794537899","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115311#issuecomment-3794537899","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115311","id":3794537899,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7iLA2r","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-24T12:09:49Z","updated_at":"2026-01-24T12:09:49Z","body":"While we can set debug build stack to higher values, it's probably better to check why GDScript is using so much stack space in debug builds instead.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3794537899/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3794539240","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115311#issuecomment-3794539240","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115311","id":3794539240,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7iLBLo","user":{"login":"cdemirer","id":41021322,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMDIxMzIy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41021322?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdemirer","html_url":"https://github.com/cdemirer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdemirer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdemirer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdemirer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdemirer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdemirer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdemirer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdemirer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdemirer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdemirer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-24T12:11:18Z","updated_at":"2026-01-24T12:11:35Z","body":"From what I understand, this is a problem with release builds too (secondary threads still have lower stack limit than main thread (on macos, and maybe for windows too), causing the issue with the usage of `Thread` in GDScript).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3794539240/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3794545361","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115311#issuecomment-3794545361","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115311","id":3794545361,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7iLCrR","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-24T12:16:40Z","updated_at":"2026-01-24T16:49:02Z","body":"It should not be macOS specific. Windows has the same sizes. Default thread stack size on Windows (and stack size we set for threads we set on macOS) is 1 MB, main thread size is 8 MB, so limit for threads might be indeed lower.\n\n- we can set a separate limit for threads.\n- we can increase stack size (but this will likely require a custom threading implementation for Windows, like we have on macOS, since `std::thread` does not have any way to set stack size).\n- another option, instead of hard-coding arbitrary limits, check actual stack size.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3794545361/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3795114292","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115311#issuecomment-3795114292","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115311","id":3795114292,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7iNNk0","user":{"login":"lostminds","id":17763524,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NzYzNTI0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17763524?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds","html_url":"https://github.com/lostminds","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-24T17:11:30Z","updated_at":"2026-01-24T17:11:30Z","body":"> * another option, instead of hard-coding arbitrary limits, check actual stack size.\n\nThis to me seems like the best option if possible. I'd guess that for most typical projects the actual limits won't matter but being able to catch and correctly show recursion stack overflows is, and this would make sure that's at least the case on all platforms and hopefully a solution that could adapt to future changes in stack sizes. ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3795114292/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]